+## State
+- A new state is a value of an enum or typed field (see `AnswerOutcome`), not another boolean and
+  not a match on message text. Two flags that can contradict each other are a bug.
+- No silent mode changes. A fallback (vector store, reranker, model) must be visible in `/status`
+  or in the answer's failure labels.
